00:27:25.820 --> 00:27:28.840
In central Australia, heavy rains have flooded the desert.

00:27:30.020 --> 00:27:34.020
but storms are few and short-lived in this harsh, arid country.

00:27:34.920 --> 00:27:36.960
As the clay pans begin to dry up,

00:27:37.450 --> 00:27:38.830
the water-holding frog

00:27:39.180 --> 00:27:41.300
demonstrates a remarkable adaptation.

00:27:48.070 --> 00:27:52.690
decreasing its body weight by as much as 50% with water absorbed through the skin.

00:27:53.190 --> 00:27:55.510
the frog burrows into the softened clay.

00:27:55.940 --> 00:27:57.820
to a depth of more than three feet.

