00:28:10.780 --> 00:28:12.840
It's active life essentially over.

00:28:13.300 --> 00:28:15.620
until the desert once again sees rain.

00:28:28.760 --> 00:28:29.980
Encased in a cocoon

00:28:30.000 --> 00:28:31.280
bag of dead skin.

00:28:32.010 --> 00:28:33.930
The frog will remain in its chamber.

00:28:34.410 --> 00:28:37.350
sealed beneath the now dry and hardened earth.

00:28:39.750 --> 00:28:44.970
In times of drought, these amazing creatures have been known to stay buried for two years or more.

00:28:48.840 --> 00:28:50.900
