00:28:51.370 --> 00:28:52.810
and the earth begins to soften.

00:28:53.260 --> 00:28:54.660
can the frog begin to emerge.

00:29:03.130 --> 00:29:04.330
It must mate quickly.

00:29:04.700 --> 00:29:08.320
so that its young will mature in time to soak up their own water supply

00:29:08.320 --> 00:29:11.240
and bury themselves until the next rains come.

00:29:21.210 --> 00:29:23.310
In the forests of southeastern Queensland,

00:29:24.150 --> 00:29:27.910
a major scientific discovery was made in 1972.

00:29:30.760 --> 00:29:34.160
Since that time, a bizarre animal, unique in the world,

00:29:34.440 --> 00:29:35.600
